  "name": "Table 64: Divine Debuffs",
  "img": "icons/svg/d20-grey.svg",
  "description": "<p><em>Rulebook Table 64 (p.313).</em> Temporary effects applied to a crawler who is Shunned (penance unpaid) or given a less-lethal warning before a proper Smite. These are narrative/mechanical effects described directly by the rulebook, not linked to the system's Debuff config entries (see <code>CARLRPG.debuffs</code> in <code>module/helpers/config.mjs</code>), since most rows here are bespoke penalties rather than the system's predefined Debuffs.</p>",
